    "needs_review": [
      "base_url moved from https://chat.zendesk.com to the documented legacy Zopim host https://www.zopim.com/api/v2. Both hosts are live, but chat.zendesk.com answers an identical OAuth 401 at every path including a bogus control path (auth wall, no path proof), while www.zopim.com/api/v2 routes: real endpoints answer 401 Unauthorized and unknown subpaths answer 404 Not Found. The vault testEndpoint still points at chat.zendesk.com/api/v2/account.",
      "list_bans ships without a pick: the Chat API bans response is documented as a keyed object (visitor / ip_address) rather than a flat list, and a wrong array pick would silently return an empty list, so the payload is passed through truncated instead."
    ]
  },
